cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Weight-Space Software Engineering (WSSE): wpgit and .weightpatch"
abstract: >-
  Version control and unit-tested patches for neural network weights.
  Weight edits are hash-pinned, self-testing text patches (.weightpatch.json) that wpgit builds,
  tests in context and merge-checks under git; demonstrated on 2017-2020 Keras checkpoints and on
  two models trained in 2026 (TinySR-26, CatGAN-26).
